<item><title>Senegal police arrest man accused of 19.2 million CFA job scam</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-police-arrest-man-accused-of-19-2-million-cfa-job-b65ab4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-police-arrest-man-accused-of-19-2-million-cfa-job-b65ab4/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>Investigators allege the suspect took the money by promising a director&apos;s post at the Port autonome de Dakar at 2.5 million CFA francs a month.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:23:03 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
